'''Snowman''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 
==Appearance==
Its blade is solid black with a snowman imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is snowy gray, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Snowman Gun (2021)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*When the 2021 Christmas Event was first released, this knife was called "Stickers", but this was soon resolved as it was unintended.

